{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/Title_Banners_Onslaught.png?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Onslaught: Rift</i> is an arcade hack and slash where you rapidly switch between three heroes to decimate waves of enemies! Learn to master each hero's set of abilities as you actively switch between them to efficiently destroy your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/Rapidly_switching_characters.gif?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture through a variety of dangerous areas, each with unique monsters and bosses to vanquish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/Running_through_areas_FINAL.gif?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your skill increases, accrue more medals by conquering harder difficulties and achieving higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/Difficulty_medals.gif?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight solo or take up arms with up to three other friends in local co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/4_player_FINAL_30fps_octree.gif?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/Title_Banners_Features.png?t=1742492903\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LINKED SOULS</strong>\u00a0- When one hero's stamina runs dry, switch to another hero!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VERSATILE DIFFICULTY</strong> - Each new difficulty brings new enemies and twists. No boring health scaling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HIGH SKILL</strong> - Your raw skill determines your pace. You won't waste your time grinding for 1% higher stats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ARCADE STYLE</strong> - Score points by killing enemies and build up a combo multiplier by avoiding damage. Earn medals on each area and difficulty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LEADERBOARDS</strong> - Compete with other players for the highest score and prove your talent!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SEAMLESS CO-OP</strong> - Any friend can join or leave the fight at any time, no matter your progress!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VERSUS</strong> - Settle your disputes through glorious combat in PvP game modes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/Title_Banners_Characters.png?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Swordsman</strong> is a close range fighter that risks taking more hits for dealing high damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/swordsman_forest.gif?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Ranger</strong> uses a bow to shoot enemies from a distance and can weave in and out of danger with ease. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/ranger_graveyard.gif?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Wizard</strong> has very powerful spells that, when used strategically, can wipe out entire groups of monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/wizard_grassland.gif?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/Title_Banners_Developer.png?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi there, thanks for checking out <i>Onslaught: Rift</i>! I'm a solo developer who's passionate about creating fun, unique games. I have always loved couch co-op, slaying monsters, score chasing, and the process of mastering a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And so I'm making <i>Onslaught: Rift</i>, a game which fits these concepts together in a new way, taking inspiration from games such as <i>Dark Souls</i>, <i>Trine</i>, <i>Towerfall Ascension</i>, and <i>Nidhogg</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for your support, and I hope you enjoy the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2437310?t=1742492903","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/655d4a0fa36384ed608c6b6ffbe6da9fd65aad33/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742492903","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/1d97b6d0e9a6165e550dc44d8e5cb9c01f8a4dbc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742492903","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/1d97b6d0e9a6165e550dc44d8e5cb9c01f8a4dbc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742492903","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/Title_Banners_Onslaught.png?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Onslaught: Rift</i> is an arcade hack and slash where you rapidly switch between three heroes to decimate waves of enemies! Learn to master each hero's set of abilities as you actively switch between them to efficiently destroy your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/Rapidly_switching_characters.gif?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture through a variety of dangerous areas, each with unique monsters and bosses to vanquish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/Running_through_areas_FINAL.gif?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your skill increases, accrue more medals by conquering harder difficulties and achieving higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/Difficulty_medals.gif?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight solo or take up arms with up to three other friends in local co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/4_player_FINAL_30fps_octree.gif?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/Title_Banners_Features.png?t=1742492903\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LINKED SOULS</strong>\u00a0- When one hero's stamina runs dry, switch to another hero!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VERSATILE DIFFICULTY</strong> - Each new difficulty brings new enemies and twists. No boring health scaling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HIGH SKILL</strong> - Your raw skill determines your pace. You won't waste your time grinding for 1% higher stats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ARCADE STYLE</strong> - Score points by killing enemies and build up a combo multiplier by avoiding damage. Earn medals on each area and difficulty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LEADERBOARDS</strong> - Compete with other players for the highest score and prove your talent!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SEAMLESS CO-OP</strong> - Any friend can join or leave the fight at any time, no matter your progress!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VERSUS</strong> - Settle your disputes through glorious combat in PvP game modes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/Title_Banners_Characters.png?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Swordsman</strong> is a close range fighter that risks taking more hits for dealing high damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/swordsman_forest.gif?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Ranger</strong> uses a bow to shoot enemies from a distance and can weave in and out of danger with ease. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/ranger_graveyard.gif?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Wizard</strong> has very powerful spells that, when used strategically, can wipe out entire groups of monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/wizard_grassland.gif?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/extras/Title_Banners_Developer.png?t=1742492903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi there, thanks for checking out <i>Onslaught: Rift</i>! I'm a solo developer who's passionate about creating fun, unique games. I have always loved couch co-op, slaying monsters, score chasing, and the process of mastering a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And so I'm making <i>Onslaught: Rift</i>, a game which fits these concepts together in a new way, taking inspiration from games such as <i>Dark Souls</i>, <i>Trine</i>, <i>Towerfall Ascension</i>, and <i>Nidhogg</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for your support, and I hope you enjoy the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Chrysolite Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437310/header.jpg?t=1742492903","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any<br></li><li><stro